Tell them about it Russ.

357
00:21:02,314 --> 00:21:05,306
You get a couple of beers in him
and he will tell you all about it crazy stuff.

358
00:21:05,408 --> 00:21:06,439
Won't you Russ?

359
00:21:07,249 --> 00:21:08,057
Russ...

360
00:21:08,428 --> 00:21:11,302
when they took you up in their spaceship
did they do any...

361
