362
00:21:15,295 --> 00:21:16,403
Do you recollect?

363
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:21,527
Oh Russ!

364
00:21:34,549 --> 00:21:35,723
Let's get out of here.

365
00:21:36,048 --> 00:21:38,290
What's going on? What's going on?

366
00:21:45,630 --> 00:21:46,705
What's that?

367
00:21:47,195 --> 00:21:48,444
Let's get out of here.
Come on.

368
00:22:13,487 --> 00:22:14,962
Mommy! Look it!

369
