Yeah.

387
00:25:31,243 --> 00:25:32,367
I am one of them.

388
00:25:35,915 --> 00:25:37,941
Hey. Hey. Hey. Come on.

389
00:25:37,965 --> 00:25:39,532
He is just trying to impress you.

390
00:25:40,509 --> 00:25:42,836
If you want to impress me
you need to get a job,

391
00:25:42,936 --> 00:25:44,660
and stop slobbering all over my shoe.

392
00:26:00,856 --> 00:26:02,564
I don't believe this. Jasmine.

393
00:26:03,245 --> 00:26:04,722
Neighbors moving out.

394
00:26:05,732 --> 00:26:08,120
Guess they finally got tired
of all these quakes.

395
00:26:10,223 --> 00:26:12,023
A little shake and they running.

396
00:26:13,230 --> 00:26:16,730
<i>Police and the fire departments are
asking everyone to stay off the phone.</i>

397
00:26:16,774 --> 00:26:18,793
Baby there is something on
the news about the quake.

398
00:26:19,809 --> 00:26:22,134
<i>The police are asking us not to call 911.</i>

399
00:26:22,234 --> 00:26:23,808
What's up man?
Hi daddy.

400
00:26:23,832 --> 00:26:25,216
What you been doing out there?

401
00:26:25,342 --> 00:26:26,750
Shooting the aliens.

402
00:26:26,774 --> 00:26:28,382
Oh you shooting aliens right?

403
00:26:28,409 --> 00:26:30,148
You think you tough?
What you got?

404
00:26:30,173 --> 00:26:31,746
Turn around.
Let me see what you got.

405
00:26:31,771 --> 00:26:33,829
Come on Boomer.
Let's get you something to eat.

406
00:26:33,854 --> 00:26:34,862
Oh no...

407
00:26:36,638 --> 00:26:38,671
Watch out. Watch it now baby.

408
00:26:38,972 --> 00:26:40,362
I will go grab the paper.
Alright.

409
00:26:43,620 --> 00:26:44,580
Dam...

410
00:26:57,550 --> 00:26:58,883
Honey let's go!

411
00:27:15,362 --> 00:27:17,637
Babe! you want some of this coffee?

412
00:27:18,337 --> 00:27:19,001
Babe.

413
00:27:26,472 --> 00:27:28,426
<i>Pentagon officials are reporting
more ships,</i>

414
00:27:28,450 --> 00:27:30,761
<i>have just arrived
over the capitals of India</i>

415
00:27:30,791 --> 00:27:32,238
<i>England and Germany</i>

416
00:27:32,290 --> 00:27:34,641
<i>bringing estimates up
to anywhere from 10,</i>

417
00:27:34,665 --> 00:27:37,758
<i>to 15 of these city-sized spacecraft.</i>

418
00:27:37,868 --> 00:27:40,204
I know Ma. Just try and stay calm.

419
00:27:41,329 --> 00:27:42,602
Tell her to pack up and leave town.

420
00:27:42,821 --> 00:27:44,054
Why? What happened?

421
00:27:44,079 --> 00:27:45,154
Just do it!

422
00:27:45,211 --> 00:27:46,672
Oh Ma. Ma listen.

423
00:27:47,298 --> 00:27:50,008
Get your stuff together and head
for Aunt Esther's.

424
00:27:50,479 --> 00:27:52,180
Don't argue with me. Just go!

425
00:27:52,897 --> 00:27:55,748
David, why did I just send
my mother to Atlanta?

426
00:27:56,343 --> 00:27:57,264
David.

427
00:27:57,553 --> 00:27:58,811
David talk to me.

428
00:27:58,836 --> 00:28:01,115
Did you hear me tell you that the
signal hidden in the satellite feed,

429
00:28:01,473 --> 00:28:03,073
is slowly recycling down to extinction?

430
00:28:03,409 --> 00:28:05,053
Not really.
It's a countdown.

431
00:28:05,290 --> 00:28:06,366
A countdown?

432
00:28:06,574 --> 00:28:08,623
Wait. A countdown to what David?

433
00:28:10,623 --> 00:28:11,756
It's like in chess.

434
00:28:12,085 --> 00:28:13,910
First you strategically position your pieces,

435
00:28:14,155 --> 00:28:15,432
then when the timing is right you...

436
00:28:15,924 --> 00:28:16,740
strike.

437
00:28:17,313 --> 00:28:18,147
See?

438
00:28:19,280 --> 00:28:21,087
They are positioning themselves
all over the world

439
00:28:21,504 --> 00:28:23,585
using this one signal
to synchronize their efforts.

440
00:28:23,609 --> 00:28:25,185
In approximately six hours,

441
00:28:25,605 --> 00:28:27,980
the signal is going to disappear
and the countdown is going to be over.

442
00:28:28,550 --> 00:28:29,683
And then what?

443
00:28:31,901 --> 00:28:32,839
Checkmate.

444
00:28:35,451 --> 00:28:36,492
Oh my God.

445
00:28:37,189 --> 00:28:38,220
Oh my God!

446
00:28:38,675 --> 00:28:39,893
I have got to call my brother.

447
00:28:40,158 --> 00:28:41,332
I would better call my housekeeper.

448
00:28:41,490 --> 00:28:42,760
I got to call my lawyer.

449
00:28:43,176 --> 00:28:44,471
Forget my lawyer.

450
00:28:45,271 --> 00:28:46,546
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,</i>

451
00:28:46,570 --> 00:28:48,506
<i>the president of the United States.</i>

452
00:28:48,531 --> 00:28:49,543
<i>Good afternoon.</i>

453
00:28:50,469 --> 00:28:52,023
<i>My fellow Americans,</i>

454
00:28:53,048 --> 00:28:56,041
<i>a historic and unprecedented
event has occurred.</i>

455
00:28:56,627 --> 00:28:59,294
<i>The question of whether or not
we are alone in the universe</i>

456
00:28:59,496 --> 00:29:00,640
has been answered.

457
00:29:02,007 --> 00:29:03,358
Although it's understandable,

458
00:29:03,383 --> 00:29:06,077
that many of us feel a sense
of hesitation or even fear

459
00:29:06,102 --> 00:29:08,453
we must attempt to reserve judgment...

460
00:29:08,871 --> 00:29:10,857
He says, he is your husband.

461
00:29:12,442 --> 00:29:13,648
Oh God.

462
00:29:16,338 --> 00:29:17,469
What do you want?

463
00:29:18,207 --> 00:29:19,661
You got to leave the White House.

464
00:29:19,761 --> 00:29:22,635
This is hardly the time nor the place
to be having that same old discussion!

465
00:29:22,660 --> 00:29:24,269
You don't understand.
You got to leave Washington.

466
00:29:24,600 --> 00:29:25,869
Well in case you have not noticed

467
00:29:25,894 --> 00:29:28,208
we are having a little crisis here.

468
00:29:28,645 --> 00:29:30,019
They are communicating with a hidden signal.

469
00:29:30,044 --> 00:29:31,153
They are going to attack.

470
00:29:31,644 --> 00:29:33,760
You are just being paranoid!
It's not...

471
00:29:33,784 --> 00:29:35,834
paranoia, the embedding is very subtle.

472
00:29:35,859 --> 00:29:37,099
It's probably been overlooked.

473
00:29:45,434 --> 00:29:46,450
Marty what are you doing?

474
00:29:46,475 --> 00:29:48,081
Get out of town as soon as you can.

475
00:29:48,123 --> 00:29:49,629
<i>Please my staff and I,</i>
Ok. Ok.

476
00:29:49,654 --> 00:29:50,886
<i>Will remain in the White House</i>

477
00:29:51,337 --> 00:29:53,086
<i>as we attempt to establish communication.</i>

478
00:29:54,247 --> 00:29:56,731
<i>If you feel compelled to leave these cities</i>

479
00:29:56,841 --> 00:29:59,210
<i>please do so in an orderly fashion.</i>

480
00:30:04,487 --> 00:30:05,910
Hey! What's going on?

481
00:30:07,202 --> 00:30:08,114
Excuse me.

482
00:30:08,139 --> 00:30:09,218
Coming through.

483
00:30:10,933 --> 00:30:12,524
<i>The arrival of the alien visitors</i>

484
00:30:12,549 --> 00:30:15,704
<i>has caused over 10000 fender-benders
in just a few seconds' time</i>

485
00:30:15,923 --> 00:30:17,712
<i>but this, is just the beginning...</i>

486
00:30:18,330 --> 00:30:20,863
Come on now, you can't go.
You got to call them back.

487
00:30:21,511 --> 00:30:23,173
I am not going to do this with you Jasmine.

488
00:30:23,698 --> 00:30:25,205
I have got to report to El Toro.

489
00:30:25,478 --> 00:30:27,435
But you said you was on leave for the 4th.

490
00:30:27,460 --> 00:30:28,798
Yeah well they canceled it!

491
00:30:31,739 --> 00:30:33,399
Look why are you acting like this?

492
00:30:33,907 --> 00:30:34,787
Why?

493
00:30:38,863 --> 00:30:39,908
That's why.

494
00:30:49,677 --> 00:30:50,387
Look.

495
00:30:51,112 --> 00:30:53,927
I really don't think they flew
90 billion light years

496
00:30:54,033 --> 00:30:55,608
to come down here and start a fight

497
00:30:56,227 --> 00:30:57,585
and get all rowdy.

498
00:30:59,224 --> 00:31:00,586
Look why don't you just relax?

499
00:31:00,611 --> 00:31:03,011
I am going to report to El Toro
and find out what's going on.

500
00:31:07,524 --> 00:31:08,945
What are you doing in there man?

501
00:31:09,404 --> 00:31:11,144
Nothing. I am just driving.

502
00:31:12,388 --> 00:31:13,177
Look.

503
00:31:13,958 --> 00:31:15,381
Here I got these for you.

504
00:31:15,807 --> 00:31:16,651
Firecrackers.

505
00:31:16,676 --> 00:31:17,716
Now you be careful.

506
00:31:17,907 --> 00:31:18,861
Steve wait.

507
00:31:18,971 --> 00:31:20,131
I want to tell you something.

508
00:31:20,271 --> 00:31:21,372
What is it Jasmine?

509
00:31:25,893 --> 00:31:27,597
You take care of yourself you hear?

510
00:31:30,892 --> 00:31:31,581
Look...

511
00:31:33,463 --> 00:31:35,026
Why don't you get some things packed,

512
00:31:35,300 --> 00:31:37,242
and you and Dylan come stay
with me on the base.

513
00:31:39,121 --> 00:31:41,675
And you will see that there is nothing
to be scared of.

514
00:31:42,226 --> 00:31:43,198
Really?

515
00:31:44,946 --> 00:31:46,043
You don't mind?

516
