Virus ineffective. Disengage.

2058
02:08:14,878 --> 02:08:16,009
Get your people out of there.

2059
02:08:16,108 --> 02:08:17,940
Disengage.
<i>Rear flank follow suit.</i>

2060
02:08:19,794 --> 02:08:20,944
<i>Hold on Command.</i>

2061
02:08:22,700 --> 02:08:24,115
<i>I want another shot at it.</i>

2062
02:08:24,140 --> 02:08:26,578
Sir I strongly recommend you disengage.

2063
02:08:26,603 --> 02:08:27,703
<i>Eagle One.</i>

2064
02:08:28,952 --> 02:08:30,070
<i>Fox three.</i>

2065
02:08:44,000 --> 02:08:45,695
Direct hit!
It's a hit. Squadron leaders

2066
02:08:45,719 --> 02:08:47,914
Fire at will! Fire at will! Fire at will!

2067
02:08:48,034 --> 02:08:50,468
<i>We are going in.
Squadron leaders take flight.</i>

2068
02:08:52,850 --> 02:08:54,919
<i>Eagle Six at seven.
Eagle Five at three.</i>

2069
02:08:54,951 --> 02:08:56,751
<i>Eagle One. Fox two.</i>

2070
02:08:56,828 --> 02:08:58,458
<i>Eagle Twenty! Fox two!</i>

2071
02:09:07,450 --> 02:09:09,885
<i>Evasive maneuvers!
Squadron leaders! Evasive maneuvers!</i>

2072
02:09:11,695 --> 02:09:12,971
<i>Prepare to engage!</i>

2073
02:09:17,850 --> 02:09:20,700
<i>Alright Mr. President! Here we go!</i>

2074
02:09:21,350 --> 02:09:23,350
<i>Alright baby. I have got you!</i>

2075
02:09:25,673 --> 02:09:27,418
<i>Payback is a bitch ain't it?</i>

2076
02:09:29,650 --> 02:09:30,375
Ok.

2077
02:09:30,840 --> 02:09:32,051
Job's done. Let's go home.

2078
02:09:32,352 --> 02:09:33,352
Gladly.

2079
02:09:38,137 --> 02:09:39,051
What's up?

2080
02:09:39,350 --> 02:09:40,350
It's stuck.

2081
02:09:40,833 --> 02:09:42,883
What?
It's not responding. It's stuck.

2082
02:09:42,912 --> 02:09:44,012
Try it again.

2083
02:09:59,392 --> 02:10:00,633
Come on, come on!

2084
02:10:34,206 --> 02:10:35,297
Steve. Steve!

2085
02:10:41,453 --> 02:10:44,053
Hey what the hell are you doing?
It's not me they are overriding the system.

2086
02:10:44,750 --> 02:10:46,250
Oh shit!

2087
02:10:47,800 --> 02:10:48,583
Hide.

2088
02:10:54,450 --> 02:10:56,472
Everybody hold someone is hand.
Hold hands.

2089
02:10:57,850 --> 02:10:58,950
Come on in.

2090
02:11:03,141 --> 02:11:04,235
I am not Jewish.

2091
02:11:05,090 --> 02:11:06,240
Nobody is perfect.

2092
02:11:09,450 --> 02:11:10,267
God!

2093
02:11:11,072 --> 02:11:12,283
Where are they?

2094
02:11:21,250 --> 02:11:22,776
This could be our last night on Earth.

2095
02:11:26,470 --> 02:11:28,170
I don't wanna die a virgin.

2096
02:11:34,550 --> 02:11:35,459
If we do,

2097
02:11:36,268 --> 02:11:37,750
we will both die virgins.

2098
02:11:38,250 --> 02:11:39,650
But at least we will be together.

2099
02:11:48,900 --> 02:11:50,140
Are you scared?

2100
02:11:51,450 --> 02:11:52,600
Me too.

2101
02:11:54,450 --> 02:11:55,700
<i>Eagle Seven fox two.</i>

2102
02:11:56,600 --> 02:11:57,700
<i>Eagle Three fox two.</i>

2103
02:12:04,600 --> 02:12:07,400
We are running out of missiles sir.
We are just not causing enough damage.

2104
02:12:08,200 --> 02:12:09,589
It's settling directly over us.

2105
02:12:19,100 --> 02:12:21,383
They are preparing
to fire their primary weapon.

2106
02:12:21,408 --> 02:12:23,308
<i>Then let's take it out 
before it takes us out.</i>

2107
02:12:29,397 --> 02:12:30,779
<i>Target at 12 o'clock.</i>

2108
02:12:33,388 --> 02:12:34,771
<i>My God they are everywhere!</i>

2109
02:12:36,418 --> 02:12:38,972
<i>Bandits on our tail! They are locked on!
I see them. I see them.</i>

2110
02:12:42,528 --> 02:12:44,683
Alright squadron leaders
I want a weapons check.

2111
02:12:46,223 --> 02:12:48,799
You are out of time!
You have got to disable it now!

2112
02:12:52,350 --> 02:12:54,737
<i>I am in range. Locking on.</i>

2113
02:12:55,500 --> 02:12:58,127
<i>I have got tone. Eagle One fox two!</i>

2114
02:13:07,850 --> 02:13:09,500
<i>That is a negative impact.</i>

2115
02:13:09,525 --> 02:13:11,725
<i>That is an NI. Negative impact.</i>

2116
02:13:12,340 --> 02:13:13,557
<i>I am out of missiles.</i>

2117
02:13:13,581 --> 02:13:14,640
<i>Eagle Two!</i>

2118
02:13:14,790 --> 02:13:15,840
<i>I am on it.</i>

2119
02:13:18,851 --> 02:13:20,151
<i>Oh Jesus!</i>

2120
02:13:22,800 --> 02:13:24,724
Sir all missiles have been fired.

2121
02:13:24,749 --> 02:13:26,356
You are out of time!
Get your ass out of there!

2122
02:13:26,550 --> 02:13:28,950
<i>We are not done yet!</i>
Get as far away as you can!

2123
02:13:29,013 --> 02:13:31,049
<i>Doesn't anyone have any missiles left?</i>

2124
02:13:31,340 --> 02:13:33,640
<i>Sorry I am late Mr. President!</i>

2125
02:13:37,100 --> 02:13:38,500
<i>Kind of got hung up back there!</i>

2126
02:13:38,650 --> 02:13:40,000
<i>Pilot you armed?</i>

2127
02:13:40,024 --> 02:13:41,803
<i>Armed and ready sir!</i>

2128
02:13:41,944 --> 02:13:43,310
I am packing!

2129
02:13:45,050 --> 02:13:46,950
Who is that guy?
Put him on speaker.

2130
02:13:47,357 --> 02:13:48,809
Pilot identify yourself.

2131
02:13:48,933 --> 02:13:49,929
<i>It's me!</i>

2132
02:13:49,991 --> 02:13:51,258
<i>Russell Casse sir.</i>

2133
02:13:52,322 --> 02:13:54,203
<i>I told you I would not let you down!</i>

2134
02:13:54,350 --> 02:13:57,000
<i>Just keep those guys off me
for a few more seconds will you?</i>

2135
02:13:57,550 --> 02:13:59,936
Ok. Echo Niner Echo Seven.

2136
02:13:59,960 --> 02:14:02,700
Take flanking positions.
I want you to look after this guy ok?

2137
02:14:02,993 --> 02:14:04,191
<i>Alright boys.</i>

2138
02:14:04,215 --> 02:14:05,943
<i>Let's give Mr. Casse some cover!</i>

2139
02:14:06,690 --> 02:14:07,515
<i>Gentlemen!</i>

2140
02:14:08,140 --> 02:14:09,541
<i>Let's plow the road!</i>

2141
02:14:17,500 --> 02:14:19,642
<i>We will draw them off 
and it will be all yours!</i>

2142
02:14:20,615 --> 02:14:22,564
<i>Look out! Coming through!</i>

2143
02:14:24,740 --> 02:14:25,986
<i>I have got tone.</i>

2144
02:14:28,025 --> 02:14:29,090
<i>Eagle Twenty.</i>

2145
02:14:29,606 --> 02:14:30,678
<i>Fox two.</i>

2146
02:14:37,650 --> 02:14:38,642
<i>Eagle Twenty.</i>

2147
02:14:38,666 --> 02:14:39,616
<i>Fox two.</i>

2148
02:14:42,914 --> 02:14:44,101
<i>It's jammed.</i>

2149
02:14:44,978 --> 02:14:46,228
<i>It won't fire.</i>

2150
02:14:50,100 --> 02:14:51,193
<i>Damn it!</i>

2151
02:15:02,300 --> 02:15:03,606
<i>Do me a favor.</i>

2152
02:15:06,230 --> 02:15:07,566
<i>Tell my children...</i>

2153
02:15:08,343 --> 02:15:10,028
<i>I love them very much.</i>

2154
02:15:13,129 --> 02:15:15,329
Alright you alien assholes!

2155
02:15:16,450 --> 02:15:18,473
In the words of my generation...

2156
02:15:19,145 --> 02:15:23,045
Up yours!

2157
02:15:23,462 --> 02:15:25,104
Dad! What's he doing?

2158
02:15:25,129 --> 02:15:26,379
<i>Come on baby!</i>

2159
02:15:26,650 --> 02:15:27,893
Come on baby, come on!

2160
02:15:31,700 --> 02:15:33,016
Good luck buddy.

2161
02:15:41,873 --> 02:15:43,794
Hello boys!

2162
02:15:44,600 --> 02:15:47,091
I am back!

2163
02:16:06,850 --> 02:16:08,058
<i>He did it!</i>

2164
02:16:08,651 --> 02:16:10,351
<i>The son of a bitch, did it!</i>

2165
02:16:13,800 --> 02:16:15,000
Alright!

2166
02:16:38,008 --> 02:16:39,613
What your father did was very brave.

2167
02:16:41,323 --> 02:16:42,863
You should be proud of him.

2168
02:16:43,900 --> 02:16:45,100
I am.

2169
02:17:03,250 --> 02:17:05,000
<i>Now we know how 
to take them out general.</i>

2170
02:17:06,100 --> 02:17:07,251
<i>Spread the word.</i>

2171
02:17:10,450 --> 02:17:13,283
Get on the wire to every squadron
around the world.

2172
02:17:14,084 --> 02:17:17,134
Tell them how to bring
those sons of bitches down.

2173
02:17:31,100 --> 02:17:32,265
What do you think?

2174
02:17:34,400 --> 02:17:35,550
Checkmate.

2175
02:18:02,014 --> 02:18:04,398
Well it's funny. I always thought
that things like these would kill me.

2176
02:18:09,150 --> 02:18:10,150
Thank you.

2177
02:18:19,083 --> 02:18:20,104
It's been a pleasure.

2178
02:18:21,445 --> 02:18:22,619
Steve you too.

2179
02:18:27,202 --> 02:18:28,744
Only one thing left to do.

2180
02:18:34,800 --> 02:18:35,850
Ready?

2181
02:18:36,734 --> 02:18:37,718
Yes sir.

2182
02:18:44,550 --> 02:18:46,505
Hey, alright!

2183
02:18:47,081 --> 02:18:48,081
Look at us!

2184
02:18:48,100 --> 02:18:49,601
Take a look at the earthlings.

2185
02:18:49,626 --> 02:18:50,887
Goodbye!

2186
02:18:51,350 --> 02:18:52,400
You all take care alright?

2187
02:18:52,424 --> 02:18:53,500
Nothing but love for you!
Goodbye!

2188
02:18:53,525 --> 02:18:54,634
Nothing but love for you.

2189
02:18:56,200 --> 02:18:58,200
Do you think they have any clue
what's about to happen to them?

2190
02:18:58,700 --> 02:19:01,087
Not a chance in hell. Good night!

2191
02:19:08,500 --> 02:19:09,550
Peace!

2192
02:19:23,550 --> 02:19:24,511
We are loose.

2193
02:19:24,535 --> 02:19:25,820
Can you get us out of here in 30 seconds?

2194
02:19:25,845 --> 02:19:27,195
I ain't heard no fat lady!

2195
02:19:27,220 --> 02:19:29,140
Forget the fat lady.
You are obsessed with the fat lady.

2196
02:19:29,164 --> 02:19:30,259
Drive us out of here!

2197
02:19:38,584 --> 02:19:40,540
They are chasing us.
Oh really! You think?

2198
02:19:48,750 --> 02:19:50,300
Oh that was a hit. I took a hit.

2199
02:19:50,325 --> 02:19:52,570
We are not hit! We are not hit!
Stop side-seat driving!

2200
02:19:56,400 --> 02:19:57,377
Left. Left!

2201
02:19:57,526 --> 02:19:58,821
Tunnel tunnel!
Exit! Exit, left!

2202
02:19:58,846 --> 02:20:00,029
Where the hell do you think I am going?

2203
02:20:00,053 --> 02:20:01,790
Ok, ok. We ar-We are...

2204
02:20:20,500 --> 02:20:21,900
They are closing up on us.

2205
02:20:21,924 --> 02:20:23,248
Is that closing?
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

2206
02:20:23,273 --> 02:20:25,690
Must go, must go faster,
must go faster.

2207
02:20:25,715 --> 02:20:27,448
Go, go, go, go, go, go!

2208
02:20:39,450 --> 02:20:41,350
Elvis has left the building!

2209
02:20:41,700 --> 02:20:43,092
Thank you very much.

2210
02:20:43,850 --> 02:20:45,450
I love you. I love you man.

2211
02:22:16,900 --> 02:22:19,450
They are going down all over
the world Tom. We got them beat.

2212
02:22:20,300 --> 02:22:22,720
How about our two delivery boys?
Any word from them?

2213
02:22:26,900 --> 02:22:28,482
We lost contact with...

2214
02:22:29,407 --> 02:22:32,024
Captain Hiller and Levinson
nearly 20 minutes ago.

2215
02:22:35,200 --> 02:22:36,250
Hold it!

2216
02:22:36,900 --> 02:22:37,704
Hold on sir.

2217
02:22:37,860 --> 02:22:38,989
I have got something on radar.

2218
02:23:27,257 --> 02:23:28,062
Sorry sir.

2219
02:23:29,450 --> 02:23:30,700
Good job.
Thank you.

2220
02:23:30,940 --> 02:23:32,990
Well done captain.
Yes sir. Thank you sir.

2221
02:23:41,150 --> 02:23:42,200
David...

2222
02:23:44,750 --> 02:23:45,759
Not bad.

2223
02:23:49,650 --> 02:23:50,800
Thank you Mr. President.

2224
02:23:53,150 --> 02:23:54,554
Not too bad at all.

2225
02:23:56,150 --> 02:23:57,550
Oh so this is healthy?

2226
02:23:59,290 --> 02:24:00,740
I could get used to it.

2227
02:24:18,650 --> 02:24:20,864
Happy 4th of July Daddy.

2228
02:24:21,321 --> 02:24:22,971
Same to you Munchkin.

2229
02:24:25,300 --> 02:24:26,850
Didn't I promise you fireworks?

2230
02:24:27,800 --> 02:24:28,603
Yeah.

2231
02:24:44,424 --> 02:24:47,424
By <font color="#ff80ff">L</font><font color="#ff6aff">E</font><font color="#ff5bff">S</font><font color="#ff3cff">A</font><font color="#ff15ff">I</font><font color="#f200f2">G</font><font color="#e100e1">N</font><font color="#cc00cc">E</font><font color="#bb00bb">U</font><font color="#ae00ae">R</font>
<i>Sync & corrections August 2022</i>

